C Electric Submersible Motor</strong><br/></p><p><img src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808241429201328061.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"image005(001).jpg\"/></p><p>3.5 Inch AC Electric Submersible Motor is one of our major products, which can provide our customers comfort and convenience. This motor is of great quality.</p><p><strong>1. Technical Data</strong></p><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"table\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr class=\"firstRow\"><td valign=\"top\" width=\"121\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>Motor type</strong></p></td><td valign=\"top\" width=\"104\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>Brand Name</strong></p></td><td valign=\"top\" width=\"113\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>Length</strong></p></td><td valign=\"top\" width=\"118\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>Voltage</strong></p></td><td valign=\"top\" width=\"113\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>Motor Casing</strong></p></td></tr><tr><td valign=\"top\" width=\"121\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">3.5QSDY</p></td><td valign=\"top\" width=\"104\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">JIADI</p></td><td valign=\"top\" width=\"113\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">347m-487m</p></td><td valign=\"top\" width=\"118\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">220V-240V/50Hz</p></td><td valign=\"top\" width=\"113\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Stainless steel</p></td></tr><tr><td valign=\"top\" width=\"121\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>Protection Grade</strong></p></td><td valign=\"top\" width=\"104\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>Phase</strong></p></td><td valign=\"top\" width=\"113\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>Motor series</strong></p></td><td valign=\"top\" width=\"118\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>Well Diameter</strong></p></td><td valign=\"top\" width=\"113\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><strong>Power</strong></p></td></tr><tr><td valign=\"top\" width=\"121\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">IP68</p></td><td valign=\"top\" width=\"104\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">Single phase</p></td><td valign=\"top\" width=\"113\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">QS</p></td><td valign=\"top\" width=\"118\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">90mm</p></td><td valign=\"top\" width=\"113\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\">0.25-1.8kw<br/>0.33-2.4hp</p></td></tr></tbody></table><p><strong>2. Performance Chart</strong></p><p><br/></p><p><img src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808241431381830409.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"image007.jpg\"/></p><p><img alt=\"image003(001).jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808241429172525931.jpg\" style=\"white-space: normal;\"/></p><p><strong>3. SPARE PARTS</strong></p><p><img src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808241431464509027.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"image009.jpg\"/></p><p><strong>4. Why choose us</strong></p><p><strong>Efficiency:</strong> Designing efficient products delivers more water, improves reliability and lowers the total cost of the system. JIADI pump will run cooler, need less PV modeules and pump water.</p><p><strong>Best Engineers team:</strong>  Our engineering team focus on the right designs, the right materials and manufacturing methods to make reliable, maintainable and repairable pump system that meet the requirement</p><p><strong>Professional Sale Team:</strong> Our sale team members are always kind and patient to answer questions and find the best solution and proper products for customers.</p><p><strong>5. Company Information</strong></p><p><strong><img alt=\"image011(001).jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808241433348145911.jpg\"/></strong></p><p>TAIZHOU JIADI PUMP INDUSTRY CO., LTD. is a company insisting on making various kinds of submersible pumps, such as screw pump and solar submersible pump to bring a wonderful life for people all over the world. We manage to offer our customers careful shopping experience. We tend to show our loyalty and sincerity to every customer and provide them with considerate service.</p><p><strong>6. About Service</strong></p><p><strong>Pre-sale service:</strong></p><p>1. Free of making offers, craft and technical guidance timely.</p><p>2. We can also make customized products according to your needs.</p><p>3. Best quality and fast delivery are the main core of our services.</p><p><strong>After-sale service:</strong></p><p>1. We provide long-term after-sale service.</p><p>2. Just call or e-mail to consult any relevant questions since we have a special line of after-sale service which will be available all day. Or you can communicate online with our foreign sales and solve the problems.</p><p>3. We will send many news styles in every week to our old customers</p><p><strong>7. FAQ</strong></p><p><strong>1. Q: How about the MOQ?</strong></p><p>A: Usually, it is 50 PCS for each model. Competitive price will be offered if the order is large enough. </p><p><strong>2. Q: I am buying from another supplier, but need better service, would you match or beat the price I am paying?</strong></p><p>A: We think that quality of products and attitude of people are main factors that help us attract customers. We would be more than happy to personalize a competitive quote for you, just email us.</p><p><strong>3. Q: Can I imprint my logo on the surface of the products?</strong></p><p>A: Of course. You are required to tell us your demands timely.</p><p><strong><br/></strong><br/></p><p><br/></p>\n</div>\n<p class=\"productsTags\"> Hot Tags: 3.5 inch ac electric submersible motor, China, suppliers, manufacturers, buy</p>\n<div class=\"ptit\">Related Products</div>\n<ul class=\"rollPro1\">\n<li>\n<div class=\"pbox\"><a href=\"/submersible-screw-pump/3-inch-submersible-screw-pumps\"><img alt=\"3 Inch Submersible Screw Pump\" border=\"0\" src=\"/uploads/201816806/small/3-inch-deep-well-screw-pump05296708319a77d.jpg?size=263x0\"/></a></div>\n<p><a href=\"/submersible-screw-pump/3-inch-submersible-screw-pumps\">3 Inch Submersible Screw Pump</a></p>\n</li><li>\n<di